ros-humble-openvino-node (1.1.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Add YOLO26 pipelines for object detection, instance segmentation, keypoint
    detection, oriented bounding boxes, classification, semantic segmentation
    and depth estimation, and export_yolo26.sh to export their models.
  * Use label files that match the models of the sample pipelines, for
    example the COCO labels for ssdlite_mobilenet_v2.
  * Add export_ssdlite_mobilenet_v2.sh to convert the ssdlite_mobilenet_v2
    model of the SSD object detection pipelines.
  * Remove the YOLOv5, YOLOv7 and YOLOv8 sample pipelines and the unused
    label and parameter files.
  * Add setup_models.sh to get the models of the samples with one command
    (core set, --all, --sample, --model, --list), and launch with
    fetch_models:=true to fetch missing models before the start.
  * Add export_deeplabv3.sh and export_maskrcnn.sh to convert the DeepLabv3
    and Mask R-CNN models of the segmentation pipelines.
  * Do not link librealsense2. RealSense cameras are read through the
    realsense2_camera node: launch the camera samples with camera:=realsense.

 -- Jayabalaji Sathiyamoorthi <jayabalaji.sathiyamoorthi@intel.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

